        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "5 Chestnut Mews, Cluain Ard, Cobh, Co. Cork, P24 PW74\r\n\r\nNo. 5 Chestnut Mews is a well-presented three-bedroom, three-bathroom mid-terrace home situated within the popular Cluain Ard development in Cobh.\r\nBuilt in 2007, the property offers bright, spacious and well-proportioned accommodation. The ground floor comprises a welcoming sitting room with an open fireplace, a downstairs WC and a generous kitchen and dining room. Sliding patio doors lead from the dining area to a good-sized rear garden, providing an ideal space for outdoor dining and family use.\r\nUpstairs, there are three bedrooms, including a spacious main bedroom with an en-suite bathroom, together with a family bathroom.\r\nThe property benefits from gas-fired central heating and a B energy rating, making it a comfortable and energy-efficient family home.\r\nCluain Ard is conveniently located close to local shops, schools and everyday amenities. A bus stop is positioned at the entrance to the estate, while Cobh town centre and the train station are both approximately a 10–15-minute walk away.\r\n\r\nKey Features\r\n•\tThree-bedroom mid-terrace home \r\n•\tThree bathrooms, including downstairs WC and en suite \r\n•\tSpacious sitting room with open fireplace \r\n•\tGenerous kitchen and dining room \r\n•\tSliding patio doors leading to the rear garden \r\n•\tGood-sized garden \r\n•\tGas-fired central heating \r\n•\tBuilt in 2007 \r\n•\tBER: B \r\n•\tBER Number: 100197367 \r\n•\tBus stop at the entrance to the estate \r\n•\tClose to shops, schools and local amenities \r\n•\tApproximately 10–15 minutes’ walk from Cobh town centre and train station \r\n•\t88.8 sqm\r\n\r\nGuide Price: €310,000"
      },
